<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GVCN | Staff Format Builder</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#111214; --panel:#181a1e; --panel2:#202328; --border:#30343b;
    --text:#f1f2f3; --muted:#aeb3bb; --accent:#54c3ea; --accent2:#3aaed7;
    --success:#43d17a; --danger:#ed6262;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{
    margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
    font-family:Inter,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 45px}
  header{margin-bottom:22px}
  h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.3px}
  header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
  .tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .tab{
    border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel);color:var(--muted);
    padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;
  }
  .tab.active{background:var(--accent);color:#071116;border-color:var(--accent)}
  .page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
  .card{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:10px;padding:18px;
  }
  .card h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 15px}
  .field{margin-bottom:13px}
  label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;margin-bottom:6px;color:#d9dce1}
  input,select,textarea{
    width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel2);
    color:var(--text);border-radius:7px;padding:10px 11px;font:inherit;
    outline:none;
  }
  input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
  textarea{min-height:88px;resize:vertical}
  .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
  .hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
  .preview{
    background:#0f1012;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;
    padding:14px;min-height:250px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:auto;
    font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;
  }
  .actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  button{
    border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;
    font-weight:650;background:var(--accent);color:#071116;
  }
  button.secondary{background:#2b2f35;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border)}
  button.success{background:var(--success);color:#08130d}
  .notice{display:none;margin-top:10px;color:var(--success);font-size:13px}
  .full{grid-column:1/-1}
  @media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header>
  <h1>GVCN | Staff Format Builder</h1>
  <p>Build moderation messages and roleplay session announcements without manually formatting them.</p>
</header>

<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tab active" data-tab="moderation">Moderation</button>
  <button class="tab" data-tab="roleplay">Roleplay Session</button>
</div>

<section id="moderation" class="page active">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Moderation</h2>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Moderation format</label>
        <select id="modType">
          <option value="warning">Warning</option>
          <option value="mute">Mute</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div id="warningFields">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Warning format</label>
          <select id="warningFormat">
            <option value="normal">Warning 1–3</option>
            <option value="late">Warning 4–5 / 6+ notice</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Warning number</label>
          <input id="warningNumber" type="number" min="1" value="1">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>User ID</label>
        <input id="userId" placeholder="123456789012345678">
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Reason</label>
        <input id="reason" placeholder="Enter the reason">
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Evidence</label>
        <input id="evidence" placeholder="https://... https://...">
        <div class="hint">Separate multiple evidence links with spaces.</div>
      </div>

      <div id="muteFields" style="display:none">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Mute length</label>
          <input id="muteLength" placeholder="1h, 24h, 7d">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button id="modCopy" class="success">Copy Format</button>
        <button id="modClear" class="secondary">Clear</button>
      </div>
      <div id="modNotice" class="notice">Copied to clipboard.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Preview</h2>
      <div id="modPreview" class="preview"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="roleplay" class="page">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Session Information</h2>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Host user ID</label>
        <input id="hostId" value="993004784556724345">
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Peacetime</label>
          <select id="peacetime">
            <option>Strict</option><option>On</option><option>Off</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>FRP speed</label>
          <select id="frp">
            <option value="65">65</option>
            <option value="70">70</option>
            <option value="75">75</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Price limit</label>
          <select id="price">
            <option>200k</option><option>250k</option><option>300k</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>House claiming</label>
          <select id="house"><option>On</option><option>Off</option></select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Trailer</label>
        <select id="trailer">
          <option>Everyone</option><option>Staff Only</option><option>PS Only</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top:20px">Map Information</h2>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Horton</label>
          <select id="horton"><option>Banned</option><option>Allowed</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Brookmere</label>
          <select id="brookmere"><option>Banned</option><option>Allowed</option></select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Highway</label>
          <select id="highway"><option>Banned</option><option>Allowed</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Current AORP</label>
          <input id="aorp" placeholder="AORP">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Game code</label>
        <input id="gameCode" placeholder="Enter game code">
        <div class="hint">The generated code is automatically hidden as ||CODE|| in Discord.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button id="rpCopy" class="success">Copy Format</button>
        <button id="rpClear" class="secondary">Clear</button>
      </div>
      <div id="rpNotice" class="notice">Copied to clipboard.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Discord Preview</h2>
      <div id="rpPreview" class="preview"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>

<script>
const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);

document.querySelectorAll(".tab").forEach(btn=>{
  btn.addEventListener("click",()=>{
    document.querySelectorAll(".tab").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));
    document.querySelectorAll(".page").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));
    btn.classList.add("active");
    $(btn.dataset.tab).classList.add("active");
  });
});

$("modType").addEventListener("change",()=>{
  const warning = $("modType").value==="warning";
  $("warningFields").style.display=warning?"block":"none";
  $("muteFields").style.display=warning?"none":"block";
  updateMod();
});

function evidenceText(){
  const e=$("evidence").value.trim();
  return e ? e : "[Evidence link(s)]";
}

function updateMod(){
  const type=$("modType").value;
  const uid=$("userId").value.trim() || "{USER ID}";
  const reason=$("reason").value.trim() || "{Reason}";
  let out="";

  if(type==="warning"){
    const n=$("warningNumber").value || "1";
    if($("warningFormat").value==="normal"){
      out=`?warning ${uid} ${reason}. **Warning #${n} issued.**

> Evidence: ${evidenceText()}`;
    }else{
      out=`?warning ${uid} ${reason}. **Warning #${n} issued; at six warnings, you will be banned from the server.**

> Evidence: ${evidenceText()}`;
    }
  }else{
    const len=$("muteLength").value.trim() || "{Length}";
    out=`.mute ${uid} ${len} ${reason}

> Evidence (if needed): ${evidenceText()}`;
  }
  $("modPreview").textContent=out;
}

["warningFormat","warningNumber","userId","reason","evidence","muteLength"].forEach(id=>{
  $(id).addEventListener("input",updateMod);
  $(id).addEventListener("change",updateMod);
});

$("modCopy").addEventListener("click",async()=>{
  await navigator.clipboard.writeText($("modPreview").textContent);
  $("modNotice").style.display="block";
  setTimeout(()=>$("modNotice").style.display="none",1600);
});
$("modClear").addEventListener("click",()=>{
  ["userId","reason","evidence","muteLength"].forEach(id=>$(id).value="");
  $("warningNumber").value="1";
  updateMod();
});

function rpText(){
  const frp=$("frp").value;
  const highwayFRP = frp==="65" ? "85" : frp==="70" ? "90" : "95";
  const code=$("gameCode").value.trim() || "CODE";
  const host=$("hostId").value.trim() || "993004784556724345";

  return `<:gvcn_round:1545262154280738947> Roleplay Information:

@here @session <@${host}>, is hosting a session.

<:Link2:1026237872149372978> Game code: ||${code}||

**Session Information:**
> - Peacetime is **${$("peacetime").value}.** **No/Minor/Major crimes are allowed.**
> - FRP Speeds are **${frp} mph**. FRP are Highways are **${highwayFRP}mph**
> - <:MoneySign:1216974961764466708> Price limit is **${$("price").value}.** Patron is price **exempt**. Staff members are vehicle **Exempt.**
> - House Claiming is **${$("house").value}.**
> - <:WSP:1217696881602334770> <:OCSO:1217697369332908062> <:GVFD:1217697480360329317> <:DOT:1217697554452709396> If you want to patrol as a Public service member, you must apply in <#1389827299888594996>.

**Vehicle Information:**
> - Heens, unrealistic limited, unrealistic vehicles, and any cars that cant reach 55 MPH are **banned**.
> - Busses & Taxies are now apart of the <:DOT:1217697554452709396> DOT Team. You must apply for DOT, and the correct division to operate a Bus and/or Taxi.
> - **German Police Car** is **staff only.**
> - You must ask the host or other staff members in the session to **operate** the following: Limos, Security Cars, and Food Trucks.
> - Trailer is allowed for **${$("trailer").value}.**

**Map Information:**
> - Horton is **${$("horton").value}.**
> - Brookmere is **${$("brookmere").value}.**
> - The highway is **${$("highway").value}.**
> - Current AORP: **${$("aorp").value.trim() || "AORP"}**

<:Arrowright:1040060887991599184> **Read <#935357255245770835>, and current session information before leaving spawn.**
<:Arrowright:1040060887991599184> **You may leave spawn after reacting.**
<:Arrowright:1040060887991599184> **Enjoy! <:cursedhunter:787842476505432114> **
<:RedDot:1217696651674648607>  **Session Strikes 0/3**`;
}

function updateRP(){
  $("rpPreview").textContent=rpText();
}
["hostId","peacetime","frp","price","house","trailer","horton","brookmere","highway","aorp","gameCode"].forEach(id=>{
  $(id).addEventListener("input",updateRP);
  $(id).addEventListener("change",updateRP);
});
$("rpCopy").addEventListener("click",async()=>{
  await navigator.clipboard.writeText(rpText());
  $("rpNotice").style.display="block";
  setTimeout(()=>$("rpNotice").style.display="none",1600);
});
$("rpClear").addEventListener("click",()=>{
  $("gameCode").value="";
  $("aorp").value="";
  $("hostId").value="993004784556724345";
  updateRP();
});

updateMod();
updateRP();
</script>
</body>
</html>
